Package: chargen
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: generate random characters from selectable character sets
 CharGen is a command-line utility that generates random characters drawn
 from user-selected character sets: numeric, alphabetic (upper and/or lower
 case) and special characters.
 .
 Random values are produced either with the standard non-cryptographic
 pseudo-random generator or, with the --secure flag, a cryptographically
 secure source (getrandom(2) with a /dev/urandom fallback).
